## Recent Update — What Changed in This Guide

Updated {{month_year}} with full certified platinum marquise inventory — 40+ settings mapped from $1,180 to $5,015+. Added the Platinum Purity Premium framework, the No-Replating Lifetime Guarantee math (50-year cost comparison), and the Platinum Hardness Paradox after reviewing 200+ platinum vs white gold client consultations over 5 years. The consistent finding: people who run the lifetime cost math before purchase almost always choose platinum. Those who only compare upfront sticker prices split roughly 50/50. Our pick remains the Six-Prong Petite Pavé at $1,895 for daily-wear rings and the Milgrain Lace Pavé at $3,250 for vintage styling.

